Please see the below Vessel Movement plan for next 48hrs.:


Allianz Juno…



  *   Vessel Currently enroute to Shuaiba Port from Rig OPH, ETA at 19.10 hrs., Vessel will remain STBY at Shuaiba Port.
  *   Tomorrow 8th May, Vessel will sail to Rig Oriental Phoenix via NSBP & Rig Oriental Dragon-1, ETD 08.00hrs.
  *   Vessel will return to Shuaiba Port from Rig OPH, Vessel will STBY.



 Crest Argus 1…



  *   Vessel currently STBY at Rig Oriental Dragon-1, Vessel will remain STBY at Oriental Dragon-1.
  *   Tomorrow 8th May, Vessel will remain STBY at Rig Oriental Dragon-1.


Crest Argus 3…



  *   Vessel STBY at Shuaiba Port, Vessel will remain STBY at Shuaiba Port.
  *   Tomorrow 8th May, Vessel will sail to Oriental Phoenix, ETD TBC.



Crest Argus 5….



  *   Vessel Currently STBY at Rig Oriental Phoenix, Vessel will remain STBY at Oriental Phoenix.
  *   Tomorrow 8th May, Vessel will remain STBY at Oriental Phoenix.



Crew change details will be sent by Rig Logistics/ Aisha/ Ahmed Modather.



Gary,

Kindly approve the above Vessel Movement Plan.

Regards,

Nirmal Mishra
